+**  \main\maintrunk.MT6620WiFiDriver_Prj\2 2009-03-19 18:32:47 GMT mtk01084
+**  update for basic power management functions
+**  \main\maintrunk.MT6620WiFiDriver_Prj\1 2009-03-19 15:05:20 GMT mtk01084
+**  Initial version
+**
